### Quick Fix: Set Department for Current User
### Use this to test the department chat feature

### 1. Login first to get token
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kaleb@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### 2. Copy the accessToken from response above, then update profile with department
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department": "Mathematics"
}

### 3. Get profile to verify department is set
GET http://localhost:3001/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Logout and login again to get fresh token with department
### Then refresh frontend and click chat icon - should show 2 rooms!
